#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Syslog Upgrade Advisor"
msgstr "Mai Shawarar Ɗaukaka Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade Syslog from %s to %s? Existing messages and rules will be preserved. Schema changes may take time."
msgstr "A haɓaka Syslog daga %s zuwa %s? Za a kiyaye saƙonni da ƙa'idojin da ke akwai. Sauye-sauyen tsarin bayanai na iya ɗaukar lokaci."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "What upgrade/install type do you wish to use"
msgstr "Wane irin nau'in haɓakawa/shigarwa kake son amfani da shi"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When you have very large tables, performing a Truncate will be much quicker.  If you are concerned about archive data, you can choose either Inline, which will freeze your browser for the period of this upgrade, or background, which will create a background process to bring your old syslog data from a backup table to the new syslog format.  Again this process can take several hours.  A Truncate discards the stored syslog and removed messages only; alert, removal and report rules are always kept."
msgstr "Lokacin da kake da manyan tebura sosai, yin Truncate zai fi sauri sosai. Idan kana damuwa da bayanan ajiya, za ka iya zaɓar ko dai Inline, wanda zai dakatar da mai binciken gidan yanar gizonka na tsawon lokacin wannan haɓakawa, ko kuma bango, wanda zai ƙirƙiri aikin bango don kawo tsoffin bayanan syslog ɗinka daga teburin madadin zuwa sabon tsarin syslog. Sake, wannan tsarin na iya ɗaukar sa'o'i da yawa. Truncate yana zubar da bayanan syslog da aka adana da saƙonnin da aka cire ne kawai; ana riƙe ƙa'idodin faɗakarwa, cirewa da rahoto koyaushe."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Truncate Syslog Table"
msgstr "Share Teburin Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Inline Upgrade"
msgstr "Haɓakawa kai tsaye"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Background Upgrade"
msgstr "Haɓakawa a Baya"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Database Storage Engine"
msgstr "Injin Ajiyar Rumbun Bayanai"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The storage engine for the analytical tables.  Only InnoDB and, on MariaDB, Aria storage engines are supported.  Any Remote Data Collector option requires InnoDB; incompatible combinations cannot be submitted."
msgstr "Injin ajiya na teburan nazari.  Injunan ajiya na InnoDB kawai da, a kan MariaDB, Aria ake goyon baya.  Kowane zaɓi na Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa yana buƙatar InnoDB; ba za a iya ƙaddamar da haɗin da ba su dace ba."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "InnoDB Storage"
msgstr "Ma'ajiyar InnoDB"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria Storage"
msgstr "Ma'ajiyar Aria"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Timestamp Precision"
msgstr "Daidaiton Tambarin Lokaci"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond precision stores sub-second syslog timestamps in a TIMESTAMP(3) column and is only available on MariaDB.  Second precision uses a standard TIMESTAMP column.  On a production system, use cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms during a maintenance window to convert existing messages without discarding them."
msgstr "Daidaiton milisakan yana adana tambarin lokaci na Syslog ƙasa da daƙiƙa a cikin rukunin TIMESTAMP(3) kuma yana samuwa ne kawai akan MariaDB.  Daidaiton daƙiƙa yana amfani da daidaitaccen rukunin TIMESTAMP.  A kan tsarin aiki na ainihi, yi amfani da cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms a lokacin gyara don sauya saƙonnin da ke akwai ba tare da zubar da su ba."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB only)"
msgstr "Milisakan - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB kaɗai)"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Second - TIMESTAMP"
msgstr "Daƙiƙa - TIMESTAMP"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Message Processing"
msgstr "Sarrafa Saƙonni na Nesa"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Remote Data Collector Message Processing"
msgstr "Kunna Sarrafa Saƙonnin Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process their messages independently, check this checkbox.  By checking this Checkbox, your Remote Data Collectors will need to maintain their own 'config_local.php' file in order to inform Syslog to use an independent database for message display and processing.  Please use the template file 'config_local.php.dist' for this purpose.  WARNING: Syslog tables will be automatically created as soon as this option is enabled."
msgstr "Idan Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa naka suna da nasu rumbunan adana bayanai na Syslog kuma suna sarrafa saƙonninsu daban-daban, zaɓi wannan akwatin zaɓi. Ta zaɓar wannan Akwatin Zaɓi, Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa naka za su buƙaci kula da nasu fayil ɗin 'config_local.php' don sanar da Syslog ya yi amfani da rumbun adana bayanai mai zaman kansa don nuna saƙo da sarrafawa. Da fatan za a yi amfani da fayil ɗin samfuri 'config_local.php.dist' don wannan manufa. GARGAƊI: Za a ƙirƙiri teburan Syslog ta atomatik da zarar an kunna wannan zaɓin."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Data Collector Rules Sync"
msgstr "Daidaita Ƙa'idojin Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process thrie messages independently, check this checkbox if you wish the Main Cacti databases Alerts, Removal and Report rules to be sent to the Remote Cacti System."
msgstr "Idan Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa naka suna da nasu rumbunan adana bayanai na Syslog kuma suna sarrafa saƙonninsu daban-daban, zaɓi wannan akwatin zaɓi idan kana son a tura dokokin Faɗakarwa, Cirewa da Rahoto na babban rumbun adana bayanai na Cacti zuwa Tsarin Cacti na Nesa."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Store Records on Remote Collector"
msgstr "Ajiye Bayanai a Mai Tattara na Nesa"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep processed messages in the remote collector syslog table after they have been delivered to the Main Collector. When disabled, records are retained locally only while the Main Collector is unavailable and are removed after confirmed recovery delivery."
msgstr "Ajiye saƙonnin da aka sarrafa a cikin teburin syslog na mai tattarawa na nesa bayan an isar da su zuwa Babban Mai Tattarawa. Idan an kashe, ana riƙe bayanai a gida ne kawai yayin da Babban Mai Tattarawa ba ya samuwa kuma ana cire su bayan an tabbatar da isar da su bayan dawowa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Retention Policy"
msgstr "Manufar Riƙewa"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Choose how many days of Syslog values you wish to maintain in the database."
msgstr "Zaɓi kwanaki nawa na ƙimar Syslog kake son adanawa a cikin rumbun adana bayanai."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Partitioning Level"
msgstr "Matakin Rarraba Ɓangarori"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables.  Daily is recommended.  Hourly requires a finite retention, and the retention and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit.  To change the level later, change it in Settings and run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."
msgstr "Girman kowane rabo na teburan syslog da syslog_removed.  An ba da shawarar na Kullum.  Na Sa'a-sa'a yana buƙatar iyakataccen lokacin ajiya, kuma lokacin ajiya da matakin rarrabawa tare dole ne su dace da iyakar rabon uwar garken bayanai.  Don canza matakin daga baya, canza shi a Saituna kuma gudanar da cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Haɓaka"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Saka"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog %s Advisor"
msgstr "Mai Shawarar Syslog %s"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "WARNING: Syslog Upgrade is Time Consuming!!!"
msgstr "GARGAƊI: Haɓaka Syslog yana ɗaukar lokaci mai tsawo!!!"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The upgrade of the 'main' syslog table can be a very time consuming process.  As such, it is recommended that you either reduce the size of your syslog table prior to upgrading, or choose the background option."
msgstr "Haɓaka teburin syslog na 'main' na iya ɗaukar lokaci mai tsawo sosai. Saboda haka, ana ba da shawarar ku rage girman teburin syslog ɗinku kafin haɓakawa, ko ku zaɓi zaɓin aiki a baya."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "If you choose the background option, your legacy syslog table will be renamed, and a new syslog table will be created.  Then, an upgrade process will be launched in the background.  Again, this background process can take quite a bit of time to complete.  However, your data will be preserved."
msgstr "Idan ka zaɓi zaɓin aiki a baya (background), za a sake sunan tsohon teburinka na syslog, kuma za a ƙirƙiri sabon teburin syslog. Sa'annan, za a ƙaddamar da tsarin haɓakawa a baya. Har ila yau, wannan tsarin na baya zai iya ɗaukar ɗan lokaci kafin ya kammala. Duk da haka, za a adana bayananka."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Regardless of your choice, all existing removal and alert rules will be maintained during the upgrade process."
msgstr "Ko da mene ne zaɓinka, za a kiyaye dukkan ƙa'idojin cirewa da na faɗakarwa da ke akwai yayin aikin haɓakawa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Press <b>'Upgrade'</b> to proceed with the upgrade, or <b>'Cancel'</b> to return to the Plugins menu."
msgstr "Danna <b>'Haɓaka'</b> don ci gaba da haɓakawa, ko <b>'Soke'</b> don komawa menu na Manhajojin ƙari."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also set the database storage engine for the analytical tables syslog and syslog_remove.  Only the InnoDB storage engine and, on MariaDB, the Aria storage engine are supported.  If using MariaDB, we recommend the Aria Storage Engine when no Remote Data Collector options are enabled; collector options require InnoDB."
msgstr "Haka kuma za ka iya saita injin ajiyar rumbun adana bayanai don teburan nazari na syslog da syslog_remove. Injin ajiya na InnoDB ne kawai da kuma, akan MariaDB, injin ajiya na Aria ake tallafawa. Idan kana amfani da MariaDB, muna ba da shawarar Injin Ajiya na Aria lokacin da ba a kunna zaɓuɓɓukan Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa ba; zaɓuɓɓukan mai tattarawa suna buƙatar InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You have several options to choose from when installing Syslog.  The first is the Database Architecture.  Partitioned tables are the only supported architecture as they prevent the size of the tables from becoming excessive thus slowing queries.  Traditional non-partitioned tables are deprecated and are no longer offered for new installs."
msgstr "Kana da zaɓuɓɓuka da dama da za ka zaɓa lokacin shigar da Syslog.  Na farko shi ne Tsarin Rumbun Bayanai.  Teburan da aka raba (partitioned) su kaɗai ne tsarin da ake goyon baya saboda suna hana girman teburan yin yawa wanda ke rage saurin bincike.  Teburan gargajiya da ba a raba su ba sun tsufa kuma ba a ƙara bayar da su ga sababbin shigarwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also choose the timestamp precision.  Millisecond precision (TIMESTAMP(3)) preserves sub-second ordering of incoming messages and is only available on MariaDB; MySQL installs use second precision.  This cannot be changed in place later without destroying the stored messages."
msgstr "Haka kuma za ka iya zaɓar daidaiton tambarin lokaci. Daidaiton millisekon (TIMESTAMP(3)) yana kiyaye jerin saƙonnin da ke shigowa ƙasa da daƙiƙa guda kuma yana samuwa ne kawai akan MariaDB; shigarwar MySQL suna amfani da daidaiton daƙiƙa. Ba za a iya canza wannan a wurin ba daga baya ba tare da lalata saƙonnin da aka adana ba."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria storage is unavailable while any Remote Data Collector option is enabled. InnoDB has been selected."
msgstr "Ma'ajiyar Aria ba ta samuwa yayin da aka kunna wani zaɓin Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa. An zaɓi InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also select the retention duration.  Please keep in mind that if you have several hosts logging to syslog, this table can become quite large."
msgstr "Haka kuma za ka iya zaɓar tsawon lokacin ajiya. Da fatan za a tuna cewa idan kana da masu masauki da yawa da ke rubutawa zuwa syslog, wannan teburin na iya zama babba sosai."

