#: includes/settings.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Gabaɗaya"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "An kunna Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, records will be transferred from the Syslog Incoming table to the main syslog table and Alerts and Reports will be enabled.  Please keep in mind that if the system is disabled log entries will still accumulate into the Syslog Incoming table as this is defined by the rsyslog or syslog-ng process."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓi wannan akwatin zaɓi, za a tura bayanai daga teburin Syslog Incoming zuwa babban teburin syslog kuma za a kunna Faɗakarwa da Rahotanni. Ka tuna cewa idan an kashe tsarin, shigarwar log za su ci gaba da taruwa a cikin teburin Syslog Incoming kamar yadda tsarin rsyslog ko syslog-ng ya ayyana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Forward alarms to Alarm Manager"
msgstr "Tura ƙararrawa zuwa Mai Kula da Ƙararrawa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allow rules set to Alarm Manager to forward alarms. Syslog email remains the fallback; command actions run only for Syslog Alarming rules."
msgstr "Ba da izin ƙa'idodin da aka saita zuwa Mai Kula da Ƙararrawa su tura ƙararrawa. Imel ɗin Syslog yana zama madadin ƙarshe; ayyukan umarni suna gudana ne kawai don ƙa'idodin Ƙararrawar Syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains"
msgstr "Cire Yankuna"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of domains that you wish to remove from the syslog hostname, Examples would be 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"
msgstr "Jerin yankuna (domains) da aka raba da waƙafi waɗanda kuke son cirewa daga sunan mai masauki na Syslog, Misalai su ne 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Sabuntawa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the time in seconds before the page refreshes."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne lokaci a cikin daƙiƙa kafin shafin ya sabunta kansa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip Total Row Count"
msgstr "Tsallake Ƙididdigar Jimillar Layuka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs do not count every matching record, which can be very expensive on large installations. The page shows Previous and Next links instead of a total and page list, and Next is offered while more records remain."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓi wannan akwatin zaɓi, shafukan System Logs da Alert Logs ba sa ƙidaya kowane bayani da ya dace, abin da zai iya cin lokaci mai yawa a manyan tsare-tsare. Shafin yana nuna hanyoyin Na Baya da Na Gaba maimakon jimilla da jerin shafuka, kuma ana ba da Na Gaba yayin da ƙarin bayanai suka rage."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Max Report Records"
msgstr "Mafi Yawan Bayanan Rahoto"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "For Threshold based Alerts, what is the maximum number that you wish to show in the report.  This is used to limit the size of the html log and Email."
msgstr "Don Faɗakarwa masu tushen Iyaka, menene mafi girman lambar da kake son nunawa a cikin rahoton.  Ana amfani da wannan don iyakance girman rajistar HTML da Imel."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Records"
msgstr "Rikodai %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Syslog Processing Processes"
msgstr "Mafi Yawan Tsarin Gudanar da Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When set above 1, incoming message processing is spread across parallel worker processes.  Each worker handles a disjoint range of incoming messages, speeding up hostname resolution and message transfer under heavy loads.  A setting of 1 processes all messages in a single process.  Worker processes are not supported on Windows or when the PHP pcntl and POSIX extensions are unavailable, in which case processing falls back to a single process."
msgstr "Idan aka saita sama da 1, ana rarraba sarrafa saƙonnin da ke shigowa a tsakanin ayyukan ma'aikata masu tafiya tare. Kowanne ma'aikaci yana kula da ɓangaren saƙonnin da ke shigowa daban, wanda ke hanzarta warware sunan mai masauki da tura saƙo lokacin cunkoso mai yawa. Saiti na 1 yana sarrafa dukkan saƙonni a cikin aiki guda ɗaya. Ba a tallafawa ayyukan ma'aikata akan Windows ko lokacin da ƙarin PHP pcntl da POSIX ba su samuwa ba, inda sarrafawa zai koma zuwa aiki guda ɗaya."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Process"
msgstr "Tsarin Aiki %d"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Processes"
msgstr "Tsare-tsaren Aiki %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Command for Opening Tickets"
msgstr "Umarni don Buɗe Tikiti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This command will be executed for opening Help Desk Tickets.  The command will be required to parse multiple input parameters as follows: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>.  The hostlist will be a comma delimited list of hosts impacted by the alert."
msgstr "Za a aiwatar da wannan umarni don buɗe Tikitin Taimako (Help Desk). Za a buƙaci umarnin ya tantance sigogin shigarwa da yawa kamar haka: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>. Jerin masu masauki zai zama jeri da aka raba da waƙafi na masu masauki da faɗakarwar ta shafa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Host Discovery Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Gano Mai Masauki"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Hostname Resolution"
msgstr "Kunna Fassarar Sunan Mai Masauki"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all hostnames are resolved via DNS lookup first (If enabled), using A and AAAA records. IPv4 and IPv6 addresses need no lookup, and IPv6 addresses are stored in compressed lower case form. If the DNS lookup fails, the system will attempt to resolve the hostname against the Cacti host table and replace it with the Cacti host description. If both DNS and Cacti lookups fail, records are assigned a prefix 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓi wannan akwatin zaɓi, za a fara warware dukkan sunayen mai masauki ta hanyar binciken DNS (Idan an kunna), ta amfani da bayanan A da AAAA. Adiresoshin IPv4 da IPv6 ba sa buƙatar bincike, kuma ana adana adiresoshin IPv6 a cikin matsattsen tsarin ƙananan haruffa. Idan binciken DNS ya gaza, tsarin zai yi ƙoƙarin warware sunan mai masauki a teburin mai masauki na Cacti kuma ya maye gurbinsa da bayanin mai masauki na Cacti. Idan duka binciken DNS da Cacti suka gaza, ana sanya wa bayanan prefix 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip DNS Resolution for incoming hosts"
msgstr "Tsallake Fassarar DNS don masu masauki masu shigowa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the system will not attempt to resolve hosts via DNS lookups.  This is useful for environments where DNS resolution is not possible or not desired."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓi wannan akwatin zaɓi, tsarin ba zai yi ƙoƙarin warware masu masauki ta hanyar binciken DNS ba. Wannan yana da amfani ga wuraren da warware DNS ba zai yiwu ba ko ba a buƙata."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "HTML Notification Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Sanarwar HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable HTML Based Email"
msgstr "Kunna Imel Mai Tushen HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all Emails will be sent in HTML format.  Otherwise, Emails will be sent in plain text."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓi wannan akwatin zaɓi, za a aika dukkan Imel a cikin tsarin HTML. In ba haka ba, za a aika Imel a cikin rubutu tsantsa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Format File to Use"
msgstr "Fayil ɗin Tsari da Za a Yi Amfani da Shi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Choose the custom html wrapper and CSS file to use.  This file contains both html and CSS to wrap around your report.  If it contains more than simply CSS, you need to place a special <REPORT> tag inside of the file.  This format tag will be replaced by the report content.  These files are located in the 'formats' directory."
msgstr "Zaɓi fayil ɗin murfin html da CSS na musamman da za a yi amfani da shi. Wannan fayil ɗin yana ƙunshe da html da CSS don kewaye rahotonku. Idan ya ƙunshi fiye da CSS kawai, kuna buƙatar sanya alamar <REPORT> ta musamman a cikin fayil ɗin. Za a maye gurbin wannan alamar tsarin da abun cikin rahoton. Waɗannan fayilolin suna cikin kundin 'formats'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Data Retention and Partitioning"
msgstr "Ajiyar Bayanai da Rarrabawa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Retention"
msgstr "Adana Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep events."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne adadin kwanakin da za a adana abubuwan da suka faru."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables. A change is saved here but takes effect only when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php rebuilds both tables; until then, partition maintenance keeps the existing size. Hourly partitioning requires a finite retention. The retention, pre-create window and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit, or the settings are not saved."
msgstr "Girman kowane rabo na teburan syslog da syslog_removed. Ana ajiye canji a nan amma yana fara aiki ne kawai lokacin da cli/upgrade_partitioning.php ya sake gina dukkan teburan biyu; har zuwa lokacin, kulawar rarrabawa tana riƙe da girman da ke akwai. Rarrabawa ta sa'a-sa'a tana buƙatar iyakataccen lokacin ajiya. Lokacin ajiya, tagar kafin ƙirƙira da matakin rarrabawa tare dole ne su dace da iyakar rabon uwar garken bayanai, ko kuma ba za a ajiye saitunan ba."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Pre-create Window"
msgstr "Tazarar Ƙirƙirar Ɓangare da Wuri"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days of future partitions to maintain for partitioned Syslog tables, so that new partitions are always split from an empty dMaxValue partition.  Hourly partitioning always keeps at least 2 days."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne adadin kwanakin rabe-raben gaba da za a kiyaye don teburan Syslog da aka rarraba, ta yadda za a riƙa raba sabbin rabe-rabe daga rabo mara komai na dMaxValue. Rarrabawa ta sa'a-sa'a koyaushe tana adana aƙalla kwanaki 2."

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "Kwana %d"

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "Kwanaki %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Recovery Limit"
msgstr "Iyakar Farfaɗo da Ɓangare"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When partitions are missing (for example after maintenance downtime), at most this many missing partitions per table are created on each poller run.  The remaining gap heals over subsequent runs; retention pruning stays deferred until the future partition horizon is fully restored.  Applies to partitioned Syslog tables only."
msgstr "Lokacin da rabe-raben tebur suka ɓace (misali bayan lokacin dakatarwa don gyara), aƙalla wannan adadin rabe-raben da suka ɓace a kowane tebur ne za a ƙirƙira a kowane gudanar da Mai Tattara Bayanai. Ragowar giɓin zai cike a gudanarwa na gaba; ragewar ajiya zai ci gaba da jinkiri har sai an dawo da tsarin rabe-raben gaba gaba ɗaya. Yana aiki ne kawai ga teburan Syslog masu rabe-rabe."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partition per run"
msgstr "%d Ɓangare a kowane gudanarwa"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partitions per run"
msgstr "%d Ɓangarori a kowane gudanarwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Staleness Threshold"
msgstr "Iyakar Tsufan Bayanin Mai Tattarawa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline health alerts warn when unprocessed messages, processing completion, or queued synchronization exceed this delay. The effective delay is at least three poller intervals and 300 seconds. Set to 0 to use 300 seconds."
msgstr "Faɗakarwar lafiyar pipeline tana gargaɗi lokacin da saƙonnin da ba a sarrafa ba, kammala sarrafawa, ko daidaitawar da ke cikin layi suka wuce wannan jinkirin. Jinkirin da ke aiki ya ƙunshi aƙalla tazara uku na Mai Tattara Bayanai da sakan 300. Saita zuwa 0 don amfani da sakan 300."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (300 seconds)"
msgstr "Na asali (daƙiƙa 300)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d seconds"
msgstr "daƙiƙa %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Backlog Threshold"
msgstr "Iyakar Ragowar Aikin Mai Tattarawa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Syslog Status page shows a warning when more than this many messages sit unprocessed in the Syslog Incoming table.  Set to 0 to use the default of 10000 messages."
msgstr "Shafin Matsayin Syslog yana nuna gargaɗi lokacin da saƙonni fiye da wannan adadin suka zauna ba a sarrafa su ba a teburin Syslog Incoming.  Saita zuwa 0 don amfani da tsohon adadi na saƙonni 10000."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (10000 messages)"
msgstr "Na asali (saƙonni 10000)"

