#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Select an existing Thold notification list for pipeline health alerts. Enabled list recipients are combined with the email addresses below, preserving BCC recipients. Lists require the Thold notification-list table."
msgstr "Zaɓi jerin sanarwar Thold da ke akwai don faɗakarwar lafiyar hanyar aiki. Masu karɓa na jerin da aka kunna ana haɗa su da adiresoshin imel na ƙasa, tare da kiyaye masu karɓa na BCC. Jerin suna buƙatar teburin jerin sanarwar Thold."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Email Recipients"
msgstr "Masu Karɓar Imel na Lafiyar Pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Comma-separated email recipients for pipeline failures and recovery. Leave blank and select no notification list to disable email; health remains visible on the Status tab and state changes are logged. Checks require the Cacti poller to run."
msgstr "Masu karɓar imel da aka raba da waƙafi don gazawar bututun aiki da farfaɗowa. Bar shi fanko kuma kar ka zaɓi jerin sanarwa don kashe imel; lafiyar tana ci gaba da kasancewa a bayyane a shafin Matsayi kuma ana adana bayanan canje-canjen yanayi. Binciken yana buƙatar Mai Tattara Bayanai na Cacti ya yi aiki."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Reminder Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Tunatarwa ta Lafiyar Pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat notifications for ongoing pipeline problems after this interval. Failed email attempts are retried no more than once every five minutes."
msgstr "Maimaita sanarwa don matsalolin bututun aiki da ke ci gaba bayan wannan tazara. Ana sake gwada yunƙurin imel da suka gaza ba fiye da sau ɗaya a kowane mintuna biyar ba."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Alert Retention"
