msgstr "Lokacin farawa na gida don tagar kulawa ta gabaɗaya."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Ends"
msgstr "Ƙarshen Lokacin Kulawa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local end time for the global maintenance window. An earlier end time continues into the next day."
msgstr "Lokacin ƙarewa na gida don tagar kulawa ta gabaɗaya. Idan lokacin ƙarewa ya riga na farawa, zai ci gaba zuwa rana mai zuwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Starts"
msgstr "Farkon Gyara na Sau Ɗaya"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to start a one-time global maintenance window."
msgstr "Kwanan wata da lokaci na gida na zaɓi don fara tagar gyara ta gama-gari ta sau ɗaya."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Ends"
msgstr "Ƙarshen Gyara na Sau Ɗaya"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to end a one-time global maintenance window. Format: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."
msgstr "Kwanan wata da lokaci na gida na zaɓi don ƙare tagar gyara ta gama-gari ta sau ɗaya. Tsari: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Alert Cooldown"
msgstr "Lokacin Hutun Faɗakarwa na Asali"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress any repeat notification for the same rule and reporting scope for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Dakatar da duk wata sanarwa da aka maimaita don ƙa'ida ɗaya da fannin rahoto na wannan adadin mintuna. Ƙimomin kowace ƙa'ida suna rinjayar wannan saitin. Sanya zuwa 0 don kashewa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Duplicate Suppression"
msgstr "Hana Maimaituwa na Asali"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress a notification with the same matched message set for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Dakatar da sanarwa mai kama da irin saƙon da aka daidaita na wannan adadin mintuna. Ƙimomin kowace ƙa'ida suna rinjayar wannan saitin. Sanya zuwa 0 don kashewa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Syslog Recovery"
msgstr "Farfaɗo da Syslog na Nesa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Recovery Records Per Execution"
msgstr "Mafi Yawan Bayanan Farfadowa a Kowane Gudanarwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of retained remote Syslog events sent to the Main Collector by one recovery worker execution. Each central database transaction remains capped at 100 records. Increase gradually while observing Main Collector load and lock waits."
msgstr "Mafi yawan abubuwan da suka faru na Syslog na nesa da aka riƙe waɗanda ake aikawa zuwa Babban Mai Tattara Bayanai ta hanyar gudanar da aikin farfadowa guda ɗaya. Kowace mu'amalar babban rumbun bayanai tana da iyaka a bayanai 100. Ƙara a hankali yayin lura da nauyin Babban Mai Tattara Bayanai da jiran kullewa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Recovery Pause Between Batches"
msgstr "Dakatar da farfaɗowa tsakanin rukuni"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pause between each 100-record Main Collector delivery transaction. A longer pause lowers Main Collector pressure; a shorter pause speeds backlog convergence."
msgstr "Dakata tsakanin kowace mu'amalar isar da bayanai mai rikodi 100 ta Babban Mai Tattarawa. Tsawaita dakatarwar yana rage nauyin Babban Mai Tattarawa; gajeruwar dakatarwa tana hanzarta kammala tarin aiki."

