#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Alert command"
msgstr "Umarnin faɗakarwa"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "When an Alert is triggered, run the following command.  The following replacement variables are available <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>.  Please note that <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> is only available on individual thresholds.  These replacement values can appear on the command line, or be gathered from the environment of the script.  When used from the environment, those variables will be prefixed with 'ALERT_'."
msgstr "Lokacin da aka kunna Faɗakarwa, gudanar da wannan umarnin. Waɗannan masu canjin maye gurbi suna samuwa <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>. Da fatan za a lura cewa <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> yana samuwa ne kawai akan iyakoki ɗaiɗaiku. Waɗannan ƙimar maye gurbi na iya bayyana akan layin umarni, ko a tattara su daga muhallin rubutun. Lokacin da aka yi amfani da su daga muhallin, waɗannan masu canjin za su kasance da gabatarwa 'ALERT_'."

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Recovery command"
msgstr "Umarnin farfaɗowa"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Optional command to run when this threshold recovers after its quiet period. Uses the same replacement variables as Alert command. SYSLOG_EVENT is clear; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID matches the breach command. Failed commands are retried. Leave blank to disable."
msgstr "Umarni na zaɓi da za a gudanar lokacin da wannan iyaka ta farfaɗo bayan lokacin shirunta. Yana amfani da masu canjin maye gurbi iri ɗaya da umarnin Faɗakarwa. SYSLOG_EVENT yana a sarari; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID ya yi daidai da umarnin keta iyaka. Ana sake gwada umarnin da suka gaza. Bar shi fanko don kashewa."

