#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The message code to look for, for example %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN or 4625. It must equal a whole word of the syslog message (letters, digits and _ . - /); a leading % is literal and must match as written. The match is not case sensitive. See How Recommendations Are Matched on the list page."
msgstr "Lambar saƙon da za a nema, misali %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN ko 4625. Dole ne ta yi daidai da cikakkiyar kalma ta saƙon syslog (haruffa, lambobi da _ . - /); % na farko na zahiri ne kuma dole ne ya dace kamar yadda aka rubuta. Daidaitawar ba ta damu da manya ko ƙananan haruffa ba. Duba Yadda Ake Daidaita Shawarwari a shafin jeri."

