#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [new]"
msgstr "Shawara [sabo]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A lightbulb before the message marks matching recommendations on the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs. Click the message to read them in the details flyout. Hovering never requests the server."
msgstr "Alamar kwan fitila kafin saƙon tana nuna shawarwarin da suka dace akan shafukan Rajistan Ayarin Tsari (System Logs) da Rajistan Faɗakarwa (Alert Logs). Danna saƙon don karanta su a cikin tagar bayani. Riƙe linzamin kwamfuta a kai ba ya taɓa tura buƙata ga sabar."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Only the <b>Identifier</b> column is used for matching. The vendor, component, severity, message and explanation are shown in the details flyout but are never searched."
msgstr "Ginshiƙin <b>Identifier</b> kaɗai ake amfani da shi wajen daidaitawa. Ana nuna mai ƙera, sashi, tsanani, saƙo da bayani a cikin tagar cikakken bayani amma ba a taɓa bincika su ba."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The first 2,048 characters of the message are split into words. A word is a run of letters, digits and the characters _ . - / that may start with %. Every other character, such as a space, colon, comma or bracket, ends a word. In <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> the words are <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> and <code>down</code>."
msgstr "Ana raba haruffa 2,048 na farko na saƙon zuwa kalmomi. Kalma ita ce jerin haruffa, lambobi da alamomin _ . - / waɗanda za su iya farawa da %. Duk wani sauran harafi ko alama, kamar sarari, alamar biyu-biyu (:), waƙafi ko baka, na kawo ƙarshen kalma. A cikin <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> kalmomin su ne <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> da <code>down</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "An identifier matches when it is <b>exactly equal to one whole word</b>, ignoring case. It is not a \"contains\", \"starts with\" or \"ends with\" search, and there are no wildcards: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> does not match the word <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, and <code>UPDOWN</code> does not match <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."
msgstr "Mai ganowa yana dacewa ne idan ya kasance <b>daidai yake da kalma guda ɗaya cikakke</b>, ba tare da la'akari da babba ko ƙaramin harafi ba. Ba bincike ba ne na \"ya ƙunshi\", \"yana farawa da\" ko \"yana ƙarewa da\", kuma babu alamomin maye (wildcards): <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> ba ya dacewa da kalmar <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, kuma <code>UPDOWN</code> ba ya dacewa da <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A leading <b>%</b> is literal, not a wildcard, and must match the message word as written. An identifier <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> matches the message word <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, not <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; an identifier without the prefix matches only the unprefixed word."
msgstr "Alamar <b>%</b> a farko ta zahiri ce, ba alamar maye gurbi (wildcard) ba ce, kuma dole ne ta dace da kalmar saƙon kamar yadda aka rubuta ta. Alamar shaida <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> tana dacewa da kalmar saƙo <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, ba <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> ba; alamar shaida ba tare da gaba-gaba ba tana dacewa da kalmar da ba ta da gaba-gaba kawai."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "When the syslog host is a Cacti device whose vendor is recognised from its SNMP system description or device template, and recommendations exist for that vendor, only that vendor's recommendations and those without a vendor are checked. Otherwise all vendors are checked, but an identifier made only of digits matches only recommendations without a vendor. When several recommendations match, the longest identifiers are shown first, up to three."
msgstr "Lokacin da mai masauki na Syslog na'ura ce ta Cacti wadda aka gane mai ƙera ta daga bayanin tsarin SNMP ko samfurin na'ura, kuma akwai shawarwari ga wannan mai ƙerar, shawarwarin wannan mai ƙerar da waɗanda ba su da mai ƙera ne kawai ake dubawa. In ba haka ba ana duba dukkan masu ƙera, amma mai ganowa wanda aka yi da lambobi kawai yana dacewa da shawarwarin da ba su da mai ƙera kawai. Lokacin da shawarwari da yawa suka dace, ana nuna mafi tsayin masu ganowa da farko, har zuwa uku."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifiers that contain other characters, such as the <code>#</code> slot placeholder or the <code>|</code> alternatives in some vendor documentation (for example <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), are kept and exported but can never match. Set <b>Can Match</b> to No to list them, and edit them into the exact code, for example <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."
msgstr "Alamomin ganowa waɗanda ke ɗauke da wasu haruffa, kamar wurin ajiyar rami na <code>#</code> ko zaɓuɓɓukan <code>|</code> a cikin takardun wasu masu sayarwa (misali <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), ana riƙe su kuma ana fitar da su amma ba za su taɓa dacewa ba. Saita <b>Zai Iya Dacewa</b> zuwa A'a don jero su, kuma ku gyara su zuwa ainihin lambar, misali <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."

